# Requests for the VS Code REST Client or the JetBrains
# HTTP client. The same requests, with tests: postman/.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health: stations loaded, routing providers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health/

### New York to Los Angeles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/route/
    ?start=New York, NY
    &finish=Los Angeles, CA

### Chicago to Denver with half a tank (JSON body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "Chicago, IL",
  "finish": "Denver, CO",
  "start_fuel_gallons": 25
}

### Whole-trip fuel cost: the same fuel at both ends
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/route/
    ?start=Chicago, IL
    &finish=Denver, CO
    &start_fuel_gallons=25
    &end_fuel_gallons=25

### Coordinates to a ZIP code (both resolved offline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/route/
    ?start=41.8781,-87.6298
    &finish=77002

### Cheapest possible: no per-stop penalty, more stops
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/route/
    ?start=Seattle, WA
    &finish=Miami, FL
    &stop_penalty=0

### Outside the USA: 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/route/
    ?start=Toronto, Canada
    &finish=Chicago, IL
